sonAirDate\":\"2010-01-22\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Behind Enemy Lines With Battlefield: Bad Company 2\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: GTTV is back with an explosive kickoff to an action-packed season full of world exclusives. In this episode we give you the first look at the single-player campaign of Battlefield: Bad Company 2. Plus, we show off exclusive gameplay from Split/Second.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-22\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Most Anticipated Games of 2010\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: It's a new decade of games and GTTV's kicking things off with an in-depth look at the best 2010 has to offer! From God of War III to Zelda, Heavy Rain to Halo: Reach, this is your insider's guide to the most anticipated titles of the year.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-29\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Undercover With Splinter Cell: Conviction\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: GTTV infiltrates Ubisoft and uncovers their plans to inject the stealth genre with a massive adrenaline shot in Splinter Cell: Conviction! Plus, we go behind the scenes with MVP Joe Mauer for MLB 10 The Show, and Kratos rocks a new GOW III trailer.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-12\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Microsoft Reveals Its Blockbuster Lineup for 2010\",\"overview\":\"If you've got an Xbox 360, this GTTV is for you! With unprecedented access to Microsoft's 2010 Preview Event, this episode features brand new details on Halo: Reach, the latest on Crackdown 2 and Alan Wake, and an exclusive interview with Peter Molyneux!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-19\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"God of War III Spectacular\",\"overview\":\"GTTV pays a visit to Sony Santa Monica as they prepare to unleash the wrath of Kratos with God of War III. With unprecedented access to the creative minds behind the game, GTTV showcases the new combat, new bosses and breathtaking level design.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-26\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Hottest Developers at DICE 2010\",\"overview\":\"GTTV delivers the latest scoop on the hottest new games with big interviews with the creators of StarCraft II and Transformers: War for Cybertron. Plus, we hang out with the doctors from BioWare to get the latest on Mass Effect 2 and Dragon Age.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-05\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Nintendo Blowout Featuring Super Mario Galaxy 2\",\"overview\":\"Get ready to fire up your Wii! GTTV comes back from Nintendo with tons of footage and details on their stellar line-up for 2010. From Super Mario Galaxy 2, to Metroid: Other M and a new Zelda title, the Wii is poised to have one of its best years yet.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-13\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"GDC 2010: Behind Closed Doors\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: GTTV rolls into GDC with one of our biggest episodes yet! Valve has shocking news and footage from Left 4 Dead 2: The Passing, Sony's Jack Tretton gives us details on the new Move controller, and David Cage breaks news on Heavy Rain DLC.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-20\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Halo: Reach Multiplayer Exposed\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: We travel to Bungie Studios to break exclusive news on the Halo: Reach multiplayer beta. From new game modes to brand new footage, we've got all the details on the game you'll need to prepare for the coming battle.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-17\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"WonderCon Special\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: We debut the next installment in the Call of Duty franchise! Plus, Geoff heads to WonderCon and interviews Jake Gyllenhaal and the team behind Prince of Persia. And don't miss the lovely ladies from Resident Evil: Afterlife, Milla Jovovich and Ali Larter.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-01\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Red Dead Redemption: Tonight We Ride\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: The Wild West teems with vice and violence in our exclusive coverage from Red Dead Redemption, including brand new footage from the game. Plus, we enter the Octagon for UFC Undisputed 2010 and debut the first trailer for Enslaved!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-08\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Spider-Man: Shattered Dimensions\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: Four universes. Four different types of gameplay. We get the scoop on Shattered Dimensions and reveal a new villain for the first time. Plus, Stan Lee debuts a Marvel MMO, and more!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-15\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Bulletstorm: Behind the Barrage\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: Cliff Bleszinski shows off the blood symphony of Bulletstorm, an over-the-top futuristic shooter that has you sliding and thumping your way to victory with a barrage of skillshots. Plus, Michio Kaku dissects the science of Portal.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-29\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Crysis 2: Infiltrate the Infestation\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: New York faces an alien invasion in our exclusive look at Crysis 2. Plus, we've got gameplay debuts for Vanquish and F.E.A.R. 3, and the world premiere of Red Faction: Armageddon.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-05\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"GTTV Presents: E3 All Access\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: GTTV starts E3 first with Spike's All-Access Pass to the show, including tons of never-before-seen world exclusives, surprise guests, and debut announcements!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-11\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"The Big Three at E3 2010\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: The big execs from Microsoft, Nintendo, and Sony join us for exclusive E3 interviews! Which company will emerge as the victor? Plus, Warren Spector talks Epic Mickey, and more!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-18\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Deadliest Warrior: The Game\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: You loved the Deadliest Warrior on Spike and now you can finally prove who’s deadliest with the brand new videogame. We’re behind the scenes on the set with the cast to give you the exclusive scoop on what to expect.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-03\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"God Of War and Fallout: New Vegas\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: We’re giving you breaking news on God of War: Ghost of Sparta, the Brotherhood of Steel comes to Fallout: New Vegas, and Daniel Kayser’s in Austin with DC Universe Online for the world premiere of an epic five minute mini-movie.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-24\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Comic-Con 2010\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: GTTV's back with major coverage of all the fanfare at the world's premier event for comics and games. This episode features the cast of Scott Pilgrim vs. The World and Tron: Legacy, plus new info on Halo: Reach, Gears of War 3, Twisted Metal and more!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-31\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Medal Of Honor\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: We've got a Medal of Honor blowout, featuring huge reveals of the single-player campaign and the game's authentic look at military combat. Plus, a new trailer for Metroid: Other M.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-14\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Portal 2\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: GTTV invades Valve headquarters for the exclusive unveiling of a new chapter in the Left 4 Dead saga and world premiere footage from Portal 2. Plus, Ken Levine scales the heights of BioShock Infinite.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-21\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Halo: Reach - Legend of the Fall\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: GTTV infiltrates Bungie Studios in Seattle to take you behind the scenes on Halo: Reach for your exclusive first look at the campaign. From brand new vehicles to devastating armor abilities and assassinations: we tell you everything you need to know.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-28\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Dead Space 2\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: Are you ready for more sci-fi scares? We visit with Visceral Games to take you behind the scenes of the futuristic action-horror title, Dead Space 2, including the world debut of the game's multiplayer mode.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-11\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Star Wars: The Force Unleashed II\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: Starkiller escapes from captivity and we've got an exclusive gameplay blowout featuring his quest to find Juno. Keighley visits the creators at LucasArts to show off a brand new footage from the single-player campaign.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-18\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Disney Epic Mickey\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: Warren Spector makes a special visit to unveil footage from his unique revamping of the cartoon icon, including two brand new areas from the game! Plus, we preview a gigantic run of upcoming titles, including Ratchet & Clank: All 4 One and more!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-25\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Call of Duty: Black Ops\",\"overview\":\"In this episode: GTTV deploys to Treyarch on an under-cover mission to unveil new details on Call of Duty: Black Ops. We debut a brand new single-player mission, plus a world premiere story sequence, and a brand new multiplayer map. The Cold War just got a little hotter.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-15\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Rock Band 3\",\"overview\":\"The fans demanded, Harmonix delivers! Rock Band 3 upgrades its instrument line-up with Pro guitars and a keyboard. Plus, check out an exclusive  Need For Speed: Hot Pursuit trailer.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-22\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Mortal Kombat: Guts and Glory\",\"overview\":\"Ed Boon drags Mortal Kombat to new levels of depravity with our exclusive reveal of Jax, along with some nasty new fatalities. Plus, 5th Cell debuts Hybrid!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-29\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Giant Fall Preview!\",\"overview\":\"Kinect finally launched this week! What's in it for you? Find out in our huge fall preview, plus get an exclusive new look at multiplayer in Battlefield: Bad Company 2 Vietnam.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-05\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Back To The Future: The Game\",\"overview\":\"We meet up with the cast and the crew behind Back to The Future: The Game to debut the exclusive world premier trailer! Plus, Major Nelson shows off the Windows Phone 7.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-03\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"Swords and Sandals at the VGAs\",\"overview\":\"We kick off our VGA Preview with a look back at the carnage and conquest of God of War III. Plus, catch a snake peek at the world of Journey!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-10\",\"runtime\":30}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2008-01-25\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}